WEBVTT

00:30.447 --> 00:31.614
Inmate 1625!

00:32.198 --> 00:33.366
Hey! Get off him!

00:44.377 --> 00:45.545
Let's get you treated.

01:08.568 --> 01:10.361
The wound is quite deep.

01:10.445 --> 01:13.740
We'll have to keep an eye on him
as he continues his treatment.

01:13.823 --> 01:15.158
How is Min Ji-ung?

01:15.241 --> 01:18.161
He wasn't hurt.
We've separated him from the attacker.

01:18.244 --> 01:20.288
Notify me
once you've questioned the attacker.

01:32.092 --> 01:33.760
Ms. Choi

01:34.928 --> 01:37.597
was the only adult who was good to me.

01:39.265 --> 01:41.976
And to such a teacher, I…

01:46.356 --> 01:49.150
I will live with remorse
for the rest of my life

01:49.234 --> 01:51.111
and repent until I die.

01:52.237 --> 01:56.282
I will not live a single moment
of my life in peace.

01:58.618 --> 01:59.994
I'm sorry.

02:06.292 --> 02:07.794
I'm sorry.

02:08.503 --> 02:09.879
I'm sorry.

02:10.380 --> 02:12.257
I'm truly sorry.

02:12.757 --> 02:14.968
I'm sorry.

02:50.545 --> 02:51.880
What are you, a saint?

02:52.380 --> 02:55.300
You'd be a psychopath
if you didn't feel anything.

02:56.259 --> 02:57.510
What did I tell you?

02:57.594 --> 02:59.179
That you'd see Cho Gyu-cheol,

02:59.262 --> 03:03.141
and a fire would burn in your heart
and drive you crazy.

03:05.101 --> 03:07.478
It's a fire neither of us
can ever extinguish.

03:07.979 --> 03:09.731
I told you, you would have to decide.

03:09.814 --> 03:11.774
Whether to live as Ga-yun's fiancé

03:12.275 --> 03:13.985
or as an ERPB inspector.

03:19.407 --> 03:20.408
You did well.

03:21.868 --> 03:22.952
Well done.

03:23.912 --> 03:25.872
Is that all you have to say?

03:27.040 --> 03:29.959
Do you want me to pat you on the head
and compliment you?

03:31.252 --> 03:32.295
Yes, please do.

03:33.338 --> 03:34.839
Get lost, you punk!

03:37.258 --> 03:38.426
Gosh.

03:39.219 --> 03:41.763
Let's go out tonight for some soju.

03:44.974 --> 03:46.351
Why aren't you answering?

03:49.062 --> 03:52.857
Living as Choi Gang-seok's son-in-law
wasn't one of the options.

03:55.735 --> 03:57.111
Get out, you punk!

03:57.820 --> 03:58.821
You can walk!

03:59.322 --> 04:01.199
Come on, we're almost there.

04:01.282 --> 04:04.327
You never let anything go, do you? Jesus.

04:04.410 --> 04:07.830
All I'm saying is
that it wasn't one of the choices.

04:07.914 --> 04:09.874
-You're feeling guilty--
-But I admitted it!

04:12.543 --> 04:14.337
-You're here, sir.
-Hello, sir.

04:14.420 --> 04:15.755
Let's cut the greetings.

04:15.838 --> 04:17.590
How's the drug investigation going?

04:17.674 --> 04:20.385
We have officially requested cooperation
from the police,

04:20.468 --> 04:22.470
and we're searching schools
for hidden drugs.

04:22.553 --> 04:25.390
The official urine-test request form
for every school

04:25.473 --> 04:27.850
has been uploaded
for the full-scale investigation.

04:27.934 --> 04:29.227
And the gambling case?

04:29.727 --> 04:31.980
We're tracking
the gambling site's IP address.

04:32.063 --> 04:34.732
We've set it up to track them
through the loan sharks.

04:34.816 --> 04:36.067
This case is also serious.

04:36.150 --> 04:37.485
-Minister!
-Keep on top of it.

04:37.568 --> 04:41.072
-Minister!
-Sir, you can't act like this here.

04:41.155 --> 04:43.074
-Minister!
-I said you can't do this.

04:43.157 --> 04:44.325
Please, Minister.

04:44.409 --> 04:48.121
You need to follow the procedure
to see the minister.

04:48.204 --> 04:50.665
Who cares about the procedure? Minister!

04:50.748 --> 04:52.625
-What's going on?
-Minister!

04:54.168 --> 04:55.962
Minister!

04:57.171 --> 05:00.008
Please just take a look at this.

05:03.219 --> 05:07.265
This is the damage report

05:07.849 --> 05:09.642
from my own investigation.

05:11.311 --> 05:12.478
And

05:13.604 --> 05:14.439
these are

05:15.523 --> 05:16.816
formal complaints.

05:17.317 --> 05:18.318
Just a moment.

05:18.401 --> 05:19.736
One moment, please!

05:21.112 --> 05:23.281
And these are medical records.

05:23.364 --> 05:25.950
And this is… Just a moment.

05:26.034 --> 05:27.410
Where did it go?

05:29.662 --> 05:32.081
Please take a look at it.

05:33.041 --> 05:35.877
Please!

05:37.045 --> 05:37.962
Please have a seat.

05:38.046 --> 05:39.756
-Please have a seat.
-Here.

05:42.091 --> 05:42.925
Here you are.

05:43.718 --> 05:44.886
Thank you.

05:57.065 --> 06:00.777
I have no one to talk to about this,

06:01.527 --> 06:03.112
and no one will listen.

06:03.696 --> 06:07.617
And it's not as if my son is innocent.

06:08.409 --> 06:09.911
You came to the right place.

06:10.536 --> 06:11.913
How can I help you?

06:17.794 --> 06:19.170
My punk of a son…

06:21.381 --> 06:25.343
Our sales for the third quarter increased
by 18% compared to last year.

06:25.426 --> 06:26.969
Our operating profit margin also…

06:27.053 --> 06:27.887
Hello?

06:27.970 --> 06:29.847
You took your fucking time to answer.

06:30.807 --> 06:32.642
You're Lee Jae-yun's father, right?

06:33.142 --> 06:34.894
-Look.
-Fucking answer me.

06:35.395 --> 06:37.188
I said answer me!

06:37.688 --> 06:38.815
Who is this?

06:38.898 --> 06:40.983
You don't need to know who I am.

06:41.067 --> 06:43.069
Just pay off your goddamn son's debt.

06:48.032 --> 06:50.243
I played a game.

06:51.494 --> 06:52.578
A game?

06:52.662 --> 06:54.247
Did you buy in-game items?

06:54.330 --> 06:56.499
How much do you owe exactly?

06:56.582 --> 06:59.043
Is it about 100,000 or 200,000 won?

07:00.044 --> 07:01.337
We're asking you!

07:01.421 --> 07:03.047
How much is the debt?

07:06.092 --> 07:09.262
About 85 million won…

07:11.806 --> 07:12.640
What?

07:13.975 --> 07:15.560
Eighty-five million won?

07:15.643 --> 07:16.727
Oh my God.

07:17.520 --> 07:18.438
Wait.

07:18.521 --> 07:20.523
What on earth did you do?

07:20.606 --> 07:22.525
What kind of game did you play?

07:48.259 --> 07:52.513
TEACH YOU A LESSON

07:54.432 --> 07:55.349
Jae-yun.

07:57.226 --> 07:58.436
Mom and Dad

07:59.562 --> 08:00.605
paid off your debt.

08:02.064 --> 08:03.900
Everyone makes mistakes.

08:03.983 --> 08:06.110
You just can't make the same one again.

08:06.986 --> 08:09.071
I'm sure Jae-yun will do better now.

08:09.572 --> 08:12.492
What matters is that you learn from this…

08:14.660 --> 08:15.828
and never do it again.

08:21.626 --> 08:22.460
Let's eat.

08:23.669 --> 08:24.670
Why are you crying?

08:30.092 --> 08:31.219
Don't cry.

08:31.802 --> 08:32.637
Don't cry.

08:44.649 --> 08:47.527
50,000 WON SIGN-UP BONUS
SURPRISE COUPON, CLICK NOW

09:03.668 --> 09:08.005
VIP GAME ROOM
UNLIMITED BONUS EVENT FOR A LIMITED TIME

09:17.265 --> 09:18.140
You little punk!

09:18.766 --> 09:20.101
You punk!

09:20.184 --> 09:23.020
We only just paid off your debt,

09:23.104 --> 09:25.523
and you gamble again? You punk!

09:27.024 --> 09:30.027
-You little punk.
-Honey, please don't…

09:52.258 --> 09:54.302
Just read webtoons on this
when you're bored.

09:57.096 --> 09:58.180
I won't gamble.

09:59.056 --> 10:01.267
I'm going to read just one webtoon.

10:26.917 --> 10:28.252
It's all right.

10:28.336 --> 10:29.795
-Just a moment.
-Look.

10:29.879 --> 10:31.339
-Hold on.
-Your kid is in debt.

10:31.422 --> 10:33.966
That means you gotta pay it back.

10:36.302 --> 10:37.928
It's fine. Just stay seated!

10:38.012 --> 10:40.848
If your damn kid screws up,

10:40.931 --> 10:42.850
you take the beating for them.

10:48.397 --> 10:51.233
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

10:56.072 --> 10:57.198
I really need…

10:59.116 --> 11:01.452
my severance pay.

11:05.289 --> 11:06.332
You see,

11:06.415 --> 11:09.210
I've tried everything I could.

11:12.046 --> 11:17.635
I put him on impulse-control medication
prescribed by a neuropsychiatrist.

11:20.805 --> 11:22.848
I even went to see a shaman.

11:23.349 --> 11:26.268
I already reported it to the police
a long time ago.

11:26.352 --> 11:27.687
But they say

11:28.688 --> 11:30.523
they can't do anything.

11:30.606 --> 11:32.942
Even if you block
the gambling site's IP address,

11:33.025 --> 11:35.653
all they have to do
is switch to a new one.

11:36.404 --> 11:41.242
There were
so many damn reviews and approvals.

11:41.826 --> 11:47.707
It took me six months
to get this paperwork done.

11:49.583 --> 11:52.128
And all the while,
time just kept slipping by.

11:52.211 --> 11:53.921
Please take a look at this.

11:54.922 --> 11:58.384
My son ran away from home.

11:59.927 --> 12:01.595
I don't even know if he's alive.

12:03.764 --> 12:06.142
I wasn't sure how to deliver this to you.

12:06.767 --> 12:08.519
I'm sorry, Minister!

12:08.602 --> 12:11.731
I'm not sure
how I should give this to you.

12:11.814 --> 12:13.065
I'm sorry.

12:13.149 --> 12:15.025
You don't have to say

12:16.360 --> 12:18.779
anything else to us.

12:24.243 --> 12:25.202
NAKWON HIGH SCHOOL

12:25.286 --> 12:26.370
Everyone, say hello.

12:26.454 --> 12:30.332
This is Bong Geun-dae, a new student
joining our class from today.

12:30.416 --> 12:31.250
Say hi.

12:32.251 --> 12:35.671
Hi, I'm Bong Geun-dae. I'm new here.

12:40.176 --> 12:42.720
Why don't you sit over there
in front of Seong-bin?

12:43.220 --> 12:45.848
Seong-bin,
have you heard from Jae-yun yet?

12:46.724 --> 12:48.976
-No.
-If you do, let me know right away.

12:49.059 --> 12:49.894
Okay.

12:49.977 --> 12:52.646
-Have a great day!
-Yes, ma'am!

12:56.108 --> 12:57.026
I won!

12:57.109 --> 12:58.152
I won again!

12:58.235 --> 12:59.320
How much did you win?

12:59.403 --> 13:00.988
-One million won.
-Bull!

13:01.071 --> 13:02.656
Look. It's for real.

13:04.325 --> 13:05.493
Another jackpot!

13:09.872 --> 13:10.873
-Too bad.
-Damn it.

13:12.082 --> 13:14.043
Fucking hell!

13:14.752 --> 13:15.961
I'm so done.

13:16.045 --> 13:17.046
Yes, 200,000 won!

13:21.550 --> 13:24.929
Fuck, that was close.
My mom would've lost her shit.

13:25.805 --> 13:26.806
-What?
-What?

13:28.349 --> 13:30.434
Goddamn it!

13:30.518 --> 13:33.103
What the hell are you staring at, dumbass?

13:33.771 --> 13:38.067
They say online gambling
wouldn't survive without teenagers.

13:39.193 --> 13:44.406
Our recent online gambling busts showed
that over 50% of their users were minors.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.909
There was even a 9-year-old. A 9-year-old!

13:46.992 --> 13:50.955
Loan sharks are always
around kids who gamble.

13:51.038 --> 13:52.873
-There--
-A few million won is nothing.

13:52.957 --> 13:55.918
Those kids owe hundreds of millions!
They owe…

13:56.001 --> 13:57.503
There have also been many cases

13:57.586 --> 14:00.130
where kids, like Jae-yun,
have run away from home.

14:00.214 --> 14:01.507
Gambling is one thing,

14:01.590 --> 14:03.592
but the related crimes
are just as serious.

14:03.676 --> 14:05.594
Most of it is to pay off debts.

14:05.678 --> 14:07.930
We will catch these punks.

14:08.013 --> 14:11.892
But we can't do it alone.
We'll need help from other departments.

14:11.976 --> 14:14.520
They say it takes a village
to raise a child.

14:14.603 --> 14:17.481
The police, prosecutors, the MSIT,
and the Ministry of Justice

14:17.565 --> 14:18.482
must all cooperate.

14:19.692 --> 14:23.487
If they refuse to,
I'll have to drag them in by the collar.

14:23.571 --> 14:26.198
But I think they're all higher up
in the chain than us.

14:26.282 --> 14:28.117
The kids' card wins hands down.

14:30.703 --> 14:31.912
Good day, sir.

14:40.170 --> 14:41.088
Where were you at?

14:41.672 --> 14:43.966
I came straight from home.

14:44.049 --> 14:46.176
Dumbass. Not that. Which school?

14:47.219 --> 14:48.178
Guun High.

14:48.262 --> 14:50.097
I got it! Hell yeah!

14:50.180 --> 14:52.433
-What is it? Did you hit it big?
-Really?

14:52.516 --> 14:53.392
How much?

14:53.475 --> 14:54.894
Fuck, it's a million won.

14:54.977 --> 14:56.020
-A million.
-A million?

14:56.103 --> 14:58.439
-You might actually buy a motorcycle.
-What is that?

14:58.522 --> 15:00.274
I won, so dinner's on me tonight.

15:00.357 --> 15:02.693
Hey! Anyone up for some good food?

15:02.776 --> 15:04.862
Fuck, Seong-bin is buying today!

15:06.030 --> 15:07.656
I hit the jackpot, suckers!

15:07.740 --> 15:09.283
I want octopus jjamppong!

15:09.366 --> 15:10.701
-Seafood for me!
-Beef for me.

15:10.784 --> 15:12.620
-Sure.
-I'll have braised pork belly!

15:14.413 --> 15:16.999
Maybe black bean noodles?

15:17.833 --> 15:19.960
I'm all in on Banker until the run breaks.

15:20.044 --> 15:21.253
Hey, hold on.

15:21.337 --> 15:24.173
Trust me, let's bet on "tie."
The streak's gonna break.

15:24.256 --> 15:26.926
Don't you know not to trust anyone
going for a tie?

15:27.009 --> 15:29.136
You mean full house, not tie, you idiot.

15:29.219 --> 15:30.429
The Banker is drawing.

15:41.440 --> 15:43.067
What is it?

15:43.150 --> 15:44.485
Can you let me in too?

15:44.568 --> 15:45.945
I told you it's just a game.

15:46.528 --> 15:47.988
Isn't it like gambling?

15:48.072 --> 15:50.115
I saw you win money.

15:50.199 --> 15:51.659
Gambling is a scary thing.

15:51.742 --> 15:53.786
This is just a game. A money-making one.

15:54.536 --> 15:56.246
Don't you play with your own money?

15:56.330 --> 15:59.083
Who uses their own money?
You get a free bonus when you join.

15:59.166 --> 16:03.837
Seong-bin here flipped the free bonus
and bought an RTX 5090 Ti graphics card.

16:03.921 --> 16:06.173
-An RTX 5090 Ti? That's super expensive.
-Yeah.

16:06.256 --> 16:07.132
You can do it too.

16:08.300 --> 16:10.594
-Shall I show you?
-Yeah.

16:11.845 --> 16:12.888
If you sign up here

16:12.972 --> 16:15.766
and enter my ID for the referral,
you get an extra 50,000 won.

16:16.350 --> 16:17.309
Just a moment.

16:17.393 --> 16:19.395
Do I really get free money?

16:19.478 --> 16:20.688
For God's sake!

16:22.815 --> 16:23.649
Give me that.

16:25.025 --> 16:27.486
First, sign up.

16:27.569 --> 16:29.571
Create your password.

16:29.655 --> 16:30.823
And for the code…

16:31.657 --> 16:32.866
Hey, see that?

16:32.950 --> 16:34.243
You got 50,000 won.

16:34.326 --> 16:36.829
Since you don't know anything,
start with Odd or Even.

16:37.413 --> 16:38.622
-Odd or Even?
-Hurry.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.540
-Just pick.
-Pick.

16:39.623 --> 16:40.958
I'll go with odd.

16:41.041 --> 16:42.126
-Tap on it.
-Right.

16:46.463 --> 16:48.048
-This guy got it.
-Let's see.

16:48.132 --> 16:49.258
You've got the touch.

16:49.341 --> 16:50.426
Even.

16:53.595 --> 16:55.097
Hey, what the hell?

16:55.597 --> 16:56.473
Here.

16:56.557 --> 16:59.601
This kid, who approached me first,
is the recruiter.

16:59.685 --> 17:02.438
He's Seong-bin,
and he works with a few shills.

17:02.521 --> 17:05.107
At first, they say they've won big,

17:05.190 --> 17:08.027
getting you curious and interested.

17:08.110 --> 17:10.446
Then they exclude you
from the conversation.

17:10.529 --> 17:13.741
And if you don't gamble,
they isolate you like an outcast.

17:13.824 --> 17:16.910
They say "game" instead of "gambling."
It's less off-putting.

17:17.494 --> 17:20.622
Is the next move
for Deputy Director Bong to lose money?

17:20.706 --> 17:23.250
But there's something I don't understand.

17:23.333 --> 17:25.919
Gambling is basically math.

17:26.003 --> 17:28.005
If you know middle school math

17:28.088 --> 17:30.507
and know how to apply statistics,

17:30.591 --> 17:33.552
it's a system where you can't lose money.

17:33.635 --> 17:34.636
I see.

17:35.137 --> 17:35.971
Is that so?

17:36.055 --> 17:38.974
You don't have to lose money on purpose.
Win if you can.

17:40.100 --> 17:42.770
Then what do I do with the money I win?

17:42.853 --> 17:44.438
It's yours as a bonus.

17:45.022 --> 17:46.356
Come on.

17:46.440 --> 17:47.733
You don't believe me.

17:48.317 --> 17:49.735
-Do you?
-Are you serious?

17:50.360 --> 17:52.988
If you win it yourself, what can I say?

17:58.619 --> 17:59.995
All right.

18:05.250 --> 18:07.628
-The 5090 graphics card…
-Is that really allowed?

18:08.462 --> 18:10.255
Yeah, you'll see.

18:28.232 --> 18:30.025
What do I do with the money I win?

18:30.109 --> 18:33.112
It's yours as a bonus.

18:33.195 --> 18:35.864
It's yours as a bonus.

18:47.709 --> 18:48.794
ODD

19:14.236 --> 19:15.779
EVEN

19:19.366 --> 19:20.492
ODD

19:45.475 --> 19:48.312
YOUR BALANCE IS ZERO
RECHARGE

19:54.651 --> 19:56.028
What's up with this guy?

19:57.571 --> 20:00.240
You must have been at it all night.

20:00.741 --> 20:01.658
Did you win?

20:02.367 --> 20:03.368
I lost.

20:03.452 --> 20:04.411
How much?

20:05.871 --> 20:07.748
-A million.
-You crazy bastard.

20:07.831 --> 20:10.125
I told you to only use the bonus cash.

20:11.793 --> 20:14.588
Are you going to do anything? Win it back?

20:15.797 --> 20:16.965
How do I win it back?

20:18.217 --> 20:20.677
You know Martingale's
miraculous betting strategy?

20:21.595 --> 20:25.057
My good friend Martingale
invented a method where you can't lose.

20:26.183 --> 20:28.977
You double your bet every time you lose.

20:29.561 --> 20:31.355
If you lose 100 won, you bet 200 won.

20:31.855 --> 20:34.524
If you lose 200 won? 400 won.
If you lose 400 won?

20:35.108 --> 20:36.902
-800 won?
-That's right.

20:37.402 --> 20:40.239
You're bound to win eventually.
We just need to win once.

20:40.322 --> 20:43.158
You're right.
If you win just once, you break even.

20:43.242 --> 20:44.076
Exactly.

20:44.159 --> 20:47.829
It's an insane, unbeatable method.
You can't lose as long as you have money.

20:49.706 --> 20:51.750
I'm the king of connections around here.

20:52.751 --> 20:54.544
I know a guy who can lend you money.

20:55.712 --> 20:56.630
Do you want some?

20:58.840 --> 21:00.592
What's there to think about, man?

21:02.010 --> 21:03.220
Hello.

21:03.303 --> 21:05.305
I've got a friend who needs some cash.

21:06.014 --> 21:07.474
Yes, about a million won?

21:08.850 --> 21:11.561
He says he'll lend it to you,
but he needs some collateral.

21:12.145 --> 21:13.397
-Collateral?
-Nothing big.

21:13.480 --> 21:15.899
-Just your parents' numbers.
-My parents' numbers?

21:15.983 --> 21:17.484
It's just a formality.

21:17.567 --> 21:20.279
We're not going to lose anyway.
Martingale, remember?

21:27.160 --> 21:29.746
But didn't you say it was a million won?

21:29.830 --> 21:31.540
I only received 800,000 won.

21:31.623 --> 21:33.292
Upfront interest, dumbass.

21:33.375 --> 21:35.585
He takes 20% and gives you the rest.

21:39.214 --> 21:41.049
The interest rate is 3% per day.

21:41.133 --> 21:43.051
For 1,000,000 won, 3% is 30,000 won.

21:43.135 --> 21:48.265
The next day, it's not 3% of 1,000,000 won
but 3% of 1,030,000 won after interest.

21:48.348 --> 21:50.309
It's calculated as compound interest.

21:51.184 --> 21:52.436
After a month,

21:52.936 --> 21:56.898
800,000 won becomes 2,427,243 won.

21:57.733 --> 22:02.362
And after 100 days,
it becomes 19,218,364 won.

22:04.197 --> 22:09.077
After a year,
it becomes 48,482,008,003 won.

22:09.911 --> 22:11.163
You did well. Okay?

22:11.246 --> 22:13.165
Good job. Well done.

22:13.248 --> 22:18.920
Deputy Bong, my man. You lost big time,
so they'll come down on you soon.

22:19.671 --> 22:20.922
Don't cry.

22:26.219 --> 22:27.054
Hello?

22:27.554 --> 22:28.930
Are you Bong Geun-dae's mom?

22:29.639 --> 22:31.099
-What?
-Answer me, damn it!

22:32.059 --> 22:34.644
Watch your mouth.
Why would I be Bong Geun-dae's mom?

22:34.728 --> 22:36.229
Geun-dae's mom, who is it?

22:36.313 --> 22:38.398
-My mom?
-Be quiet! She's on the phone.

22:41.193 --> 22:43.153
Yes, I'm Geun-dae's mom.

22:43.236 --> 22:45.405
You need to pay off your son's debt.

22:46.198 --> 22:47.824
Did my son gamble again?

22:47.908 --> 22:48.992
How much this time?

22:49.076 --> 22:51.495
The kid plays on a fucking grand scale.
20 million.

22:54.039 --> 22:57.042
-Hey, lady. Pay me back fast.
-You did well.

22:57.125 --> 22:59.252
The interest alone
will be 600,000 won tomorrow.

22:59.753 --> 23:03.256
I can't pay it back.
I've paid his debts time and again.

23:03.924 --> 23:06.843
Trying to save this fool
will destroy my family.

23:06.927 --> 23:10.055
I've given up on Geun-dae.
Do as you wish. Kill him or don't.

23:10.722 --> 23:11.765
Damn it.

23:13.600 --> 23:15.102
He's calling me again.

23:15.185 --> 23:16.520
Again! For God's sake.

23:18.480 --> 23:19.439
What do we do now?

23:19.523 --> 23:21.525
These recruiters
are probably just small fry.

23:21.608 --> 23:23.110
Operations like this run on cash.

23:23.193 --> 23:25.987
The guys actually handling the money
know who's at the top.

23:28.115 --> 23:30.909
Our Deputy Bong lost big time, right?

23:30.992 --> 23:32.994
So they'll have the enforcers
come after you.

23:33.078 --> 23:34.538
We catch those guys

23:35.664 --> 23:38.917
and take down… those at the top.

23:41.128 --> 23:42.963
Come on, don't cry.

23:43.463 --> 23:44.297
Okay.

23:45.340 --> 23:47.426
NAKWON HIGH SCHOOL

23:50.929 --> 23:54.724
There's no sign of the enforcers.
You're watching me closely, right?

23:56.393 --> 23:58.812
I'm close by, watching over you.

24:07.112 --> 24:07.946
Damn it.

24:08.029 --> 24:10.282
I picked the wrong spot.

24:14.327 --> 24:16.288
DELICIOUS GIMBAP, TTEOKBOKKI,
TWIGIM, SUNDAE

24:32.220 --> 24:33.972
-Hello!
-Hi, welcome.

24:34.055 --> 24:36.183
-Just one portion, please.
-Order more.

24:36.266 --> 24:38.768
-Come on, here. I'll give you lots.
-Damn.

24:38.852 --> 24:40.979
That's awesome. Thank you.

24:41.062 --> 24:42.105
Enjoy.

24:43.064 --> 24:43.982
Thank you.

24:44.065 --> 24:45.650
-How sweet.
-It looks so good.

24:45.734 --> 24:47.486
-Enjoy.
-We will. Thank you.

24:47.569 --> 24:49.571
Ma'am, can I please get one tteokbokki?

24:49.654 --> 24:50.739
All right.

24:50.822 --> 24:52.782
-Please mix in some twigim.
-Here you go.

24:52.866 --> 24:55.785
-Thank you.
-Sure, please enjoy.

25:22.771 --> 25:24.940
Unlock your phones and hand them over.

25:28.193 --> 25:29.402
Hurry up!

25:31.404 --> 25:33.448
Hurry up and hand them over.

25:34.407 --> 25:35.617
Hurry up.

25:35.700 --> 25:38.119
Just fucking hand them over!

25:41.164 --> 25:42.165
Hey.

25:42.666 --> 25:43.708
I said hand it over.

25:44.501 --> 25:46.962
It's the fingerprint recognition.

25:47.045 --> 25:48.838
-It's not working.
-Give it here.

25:56.513 --> 25:57.514
-Oh no.
-Damn it.

25:57.597 --> 25:59.140
-I'm sorry.
-Fucking hell.

25:59.224 --> 26:00.350
For fuck's sake.

26:00.850 --> 26:02.102
Oh no.

26:02.602 --> 26:03.979
My phone

26:05.105 --> 26:06.982
fell into the sewer.

26:07.065 --> 26:10.277
For fuck's sake.
You're a real piece of work.

26:10.860 --> 26:12.320
I'm sorry.

26:23.290 --> 26:27.794
INSPECTOR IM HAN-RIM

26:27.877 --> 26:29.879
I definitely saw him make it this far.

26:29.963 --> 26:32.382
I watched him from over there,
making eye contact.

26:32.465 --> 26:34.759
-The call cannot be connected.
-He's not answering.

26:34.843 --> 26:36.970
Get that CCTV footage. Let's go.

26:39.973 --> 26:42.767
My money!

26:43.435 --> 26:46.021
Pay me back, or you're all fucking dead.

26:46.521 --> 26:48.481
Your parents won't pay your debts anymore.

26:48.565 --> 26:51.067
You'll have to earn the money
to pay me back.

26:51.776 --> 26:53.069
Take this. Take it.

26:55.071 --> 26:57.741
Go empty the ice cream shop's cash box.

26:58.700 --> 26:59.868
Move it!

27:24.225 --> 27:25.268
Good.

27:29.356 --> 27:30.190
Good job.

27:30.940 --> 27:31.775
Get in.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.450
If you don't do it,

27:41.368 --> 27:42.661
you'll be dead.

27:42.744 --> 27:44.037
You get what I'm saying?

27:44.829 --> 27:47.040
-Why are you--
-Hold it. I said hold it properly.

27:48.875 --> 27:50.210
-No, I can't.
-Get out, moron.

27:50.293 --> 27:51.378
-I can't.
-Get out.

27:51.461 --> 27:53.088
-Get the fuck out.
-I really can't.

27:53.171 --> 27:55.632
-I said get the fuck out.
-No, I really can't do it.

27:55.715 --> 27:57.467
For fuck's sake.

28:07.560 --> 28:08.687
-You little shit.
-What…

28:09.562 --> 28:10.980
Do you know who I am, moron?

28:11.564 --> 28:12.440
-Hey!
-What the…

28:12.524 --> 28:13.358
-I'm scared.
-Hey!

28:13.441 --> 28:15.443
Sir, are you all right? Get it together.

28:28.998 --> 28:29.833
Shit.

28:32.293 --> 28:33.503
Run the plate

28:33.586 --> 28:36.047
and track the vehicle on the CCTV.

28:36.131 --> 28:38.675
I'll go to traffic control
and get their cooperation.

28:38.758 --> 28:39.592
Yes, sir.

28:44.764 --> 28:45.890
We don't have time.

28:45.974 --> 28:47.183
Get your head together.

28:47.267 --> 28:48.852
It's all my fault.

28:50.061 --> 28:53.314
I lost Deputy Director Bong
because of that fucking tteokbokki!

28:53.815 --> 28:56.568
What if something happens to him
because of me?

28:58.570 --> 29:00.196
Sergeant Im Han-rim!

29:00.280 --> 29:01.990
That's right, Sergeant Im Han-rim.

29:03.700 --> 29:05.785
You can make up for mistakes,

29:07.370 --> 29:09.038
but giving up is failure.

29:11.541 --> 29:12.417
Understood?

29:13.418 --> 29:14.711
Yes, sir. Understood!

29:18.590 --> 29:19.507
Get moving.

29:25.472 --> 29:26.306
What the hell?

29:26.389 --> 29:27.766
Where did all the morons go?

29:27.849 --> 29:29.893
Seriously, for fuck's sake.

29:29.976 --> 29:31.603
Fucking hell. Hey!

29:31.686 --> 29:33.271
I told you to close your eyes.

29:43.156 --> 29:44.324
Don't push me.

29:45.325 --> 29:46.659
Wait a moment.

29:46.743 --> 29:48.161
-Wait.
-Hello, boss!

29:48.244 --> 29:50.914
You fucking bastards.
Really? You're eating now?

29:50.997 --> 29:52.040
I'm sorry, bro.

29:52.123 --> 29:53.792
Do I have to deal with kids myself?

29:53.875 --> 29:55.168
-Damn it.
-I'm sorry!

29:56.211 --> 29:58.254
-Get your act together.
-Yes, bro!

29:59.130 --> 30:01.216
Fucking morons.

30:01.299 --> 30:02.884
-Good night.
-Good night.

30:03.718 --> 30:05.220
This moron is a newbie.

30:05.303 --> 30:06.971
Train him and get him started.

30:07.055 --> 30:08.515
Yes, bro!

30:09.933 --> 30:11.267
Fucking follow me.

30:12.393 --> 30:14.979
That's my bag.

30:15.063 --> 30:17.398
-For fuck's sake. Come with me.
-Wait…

30:23.947 --> 30:25.073
-Sit.
-Sorry?

30:25.156 --> 30:26.533
-I said sit.
-Right.

30:27.408 --> 30:28.368
Okay.

30:28.451 --> 30:31.037
Look. This is what you'll be doing, okay?

30:31.746 --> 30:34.040
Now, tonight… See these numbers?

30:34.123 --> 30:35.750
Send out a text to all of them.

30:36.417 --> 30:37.293
Got it?

30:37.877 --> 30:38.711
Yes.

30:38.795 --> 30:40.755
You look dumb as fuck.

30:41.256 --> 30:42.590
Goddamn it.

30:48.847 --> 30:50.932
TEXT RECIPIENT LIST

30:59.107 --> 31:00.441
IT'S BONG, I'VE BEEN TAKEN

31:02.986 --> 31:03.820
You're…

31:06.489 --> 31:08.408
We're all being watched here.

31:10.326 --> 31:12.120
They're watching our monitors too.

31:12.203 --> 31:14.581
Who the fuck is talking?

31:21.212 --> 31:23.590
Fucking hell. Look at me.

31:23.673 --> 31:26.801
You son of a bitch.
When did I say you could open your trap?

31:29.804 --> 31:32.807
You're fucking pissing me off,
you goddamn bastard.

31:34.559 --> 31:36.019
You fucking moron.

31:36.102 --> 31:37.770
Why don't you listen?

31:37.854 --> 31:38.980
You fucking bastard.

31:39.063 --> 31:42.692
Don't fucking act
like you're in pain, all right?

31:48.656 --> 31:49.699
50,000 WON BONUS

31:49.782 --> 31:51.200
MESSAGE HAS BEEN SENT

31:51.284 --> 31:54.787
Get the hell out, goddamn dumbasses.
You fucking morons.

31:54.871 --> 31:57.582
You're fucking useless.
I said get the hell out!

32:00.376 --> 32:02.712
Get back to work, you fuckers.

32:03.254 --> 32:05.256
-Damn it.
-What's the boss flipping over now?

32:05.340 --> 32:07.508
There's a problem
with the Cambodian server.

32:07.592 --> 32:10.970
I hear it's lagging
because of damn traffic spikes.

32:11.054 --> 32:13.431
-Damn complaint calls keep coming in.
-I know, fuck.

32:13.932 --> 32:16.809
-That's not on us.
-Why is he taking it out on us? Damn it.

32:19.354 --> 32:20.438
Are you asleep?

32:20.521 --> 32:23.358
Wow, I already feel like fucking shit,
and you're asleep.

32:23.441 --> 32:25.610
Fine, I'll make sure
you fucking stay asleep.

32:28.154 --> 32:30.073
Please!

32:30.573 --> 32:32.533
I'll put you to sleep forever, you fucker.

32:32.617 --> 32:34.452
Just a moment.

32:34.535 --> 32:37.205
I think I can do it.

32:38.414 --> 32:40.750
-Do what?
-The Cambodian server.

32:40.833 --> 32:44.170
I think you need to set up a reverse proxy
to distribute the traffic.

32:44.253 --> 32:47.799
-Are you good with computers?
-Yes, I love computers.

32:49.509 --> 32:51.552
-Yeah? Come here.
-Okay.

33:06.567 --> 33:07.777
Come on, this way.

33:07.860 --> 33:10.113
I told you
the server keeps fucking crashing.

33:10.196 --> 33:11.948
-Bro.
-Why do you keep…

33:12.573 --> 33:13.783
What?

33:13.866 --> 33:16.244
I think you should talk to this guy.

33:23.543 --> 33:25.378
Since there's lag,

33:25.461 --> 33:28.423
there are a few ways
to reduce the server load.

33:28.506 --> 33:31.467
What I'm doing is setting up
something called a reverse proxy,

33:31.551 --> 33:35.221
which is like a gatekeeper
that sits in front of the server.

33:35.304 --> 33:36.723
Okay, go ahead.

33:37.598 --> 33:40.184
If it doesn't work,
I'm going to gouge your eyes out.

33:40.268 --> 33:41.602
That way, you saw nothing.

33:43.312 --> 33:44.147
Okay?

33:44.856 --> 33:45.857
Yes.

34:07.295 --> 34:10.715
Even a nobody has talent, don't they?

34:11.299 --> 34:12.800
Take it.

34:13.468 --> 34:15.970
You enjoy, all right? Here.

34:18.765 --> 34:20.641
Here, have some water too.

34:28.441 --> 34:29.484
He's asleep again.

34:29.567 --> 34:31.569
Damn it.

34:37.575 --> 34:40.036
-What's wrong with this guy?
-He kept dozing off.

34:41.245 --> 34:42.080
Hey.

34:43.122 --> 34:46.334
You've got to be kidding me. Fucking hell.

34:47.210 --> 34:48.044
Get rid of him.

34:48.127 --> 34:49.337
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

34:49.921 --> 34:52.173
Hey, get up. For God's sake.

34:56.052 --> 34:58.137
Don't worry about him.

35:07.438 --> 35:09.482
It turned out to be a ghost car.

35:09.565 --> 35:12.318
And it went off CCTV
after Susaek interchange.

35:12.401 --> 35:14.737
We tracked his phone,

35:14.821 --> 35:16.405
but it was broken.

35:18.991 --> 35:19.826
And the kids?

35:19.909 --> 35:22.662
Inspector Im Han-rim is looking for--

35:22.745 --> 35:24.705
Get in, you punk. Sit down.

35:25.665 --> 35:26.833
Sit down.

35:27.333 --> 35:28.793
I'm telling the truth.

35:28.876 --> 35:33.172
All I did was make the kids play the game.
I don't know where the company is.

35:35.550 --> 35:36.551
Find it.

35:36.634 --> 35:38.553
Which banner links
to those bastards' site?

35:40.346 --> 35:41.848
Find it!

35:45.852 --> 35:46.686
For God's sake.

35:46.769 --> 35:48.396
VIP GAME ROOM

35:48.479 --> 35:51.649
I'll head over to the MSIT
and get the information on…

36:13.129 --> 36:14.213
What are you doing?

36:29.061 --> 36:31.480
MUSANGOL

36:36.360 --> 36:38.404
Mansin Aegi. Musangol Mansin Aegi.

36:40.406 --> 36:42.074
Musangol Mansin Aegi?

36:42.158 --> 36:43.451
What do you mean?

36:43.534 --> 36:45.703
One of the banners
is flashing differently.

36:45.786 --> 36:46.704
It's Morse code.

36:46.787 --> 36:49.916
The duration of each flash
represents a letter.

36:49.999 --> 36:51.459
"Bong Geun-dae. My location is…"

36:52.960 --> 36:53.794
I found it.

36:55.087 --> 36:56.464
Musangol Mansin Aegi.

37:05.514 --> 37:09.393
MUSANGOL MANSIN AEGI SHRINE

37:26.410 --> 37:27.578
There's nothing here.

37:28.246 --> 37:29.497
Must've been a coincidence.

37:29.580 --> 37:33.376
-This can't be a coincidence.
-But there's nothing here!

37:35.878 --> 37:37.922
What if he saw the sign
from another building?

37:58.651 --> 37:59.610
Im Han-rim.

38:02.655 --> 38:04.365
Hey, you little asshole.

38:04.448 --> 38:05.574
Go smoke outside.

38:06.075 --> 38:07.285
You're rotting my lungs.

38:07.368 --> 38:08.828
Bong Geun-dae!

38:10.288 --> 38:11.580
Bong Geun-dae!

38:12.081 --> 38:13.332
Who are you?

38:13.916 --> 38:15.751
-Hey, don't kill--
-Who are you?

38:15.835 --> 38:17.295
What the fuck?

38:18.796 --> 38:20.715
Hey, here.

38:21.674 --> 38:23.426
Share this between you two.

38:23.509 --> 38:25.344
You too.

38:26.846 --> 38:28.556
Shit. What the hell?

38:29.056 --> 38:30.099
Bong Geun-dae!

38:31.183 --> 38:32.560
Has anyone seen Bong Geun-dae?

38:32.643 --> 38:34.854
His eyes are a little small,
but they sparkle.

38:34.937 --> 38:36.689
He gives major geek vibes,

38:37.523 --> 38:39.150
but up close, he's got a cute face.

38:39.233 --> 38:42.403
He's tall and looks like a smart cookie!

38:42.486 --> 38:43.487
What the hell?

38:47.366 --> 38:48.242
Answer me!

38:49.327 --> 38:50.328
A cute face?

38:51.579 --> 38:52.788
It's a girl.

38:52.872 --> 38:54.206
Is she someone's sister?

38:55.708 --> 38:57.126
What a dumbass. She's a girl.

38:58.002 --> 38:59.045
Hey, Han-rim.

38:59.545 --> 39:01.464
Don't get emotional, all right? Don't…

39:03.007 --> 39:04.050
She's doing her hair.

39:04.133 --> 39:05.926
Answer me.

39:06.010 --> 39:07.678
-We're not here to kill them.
-No?

39:07.762 --> 39:10.056
We're here to find
our guy with sparkling eyes.

39:10.639 --> 39:12.433
-Im Han-rim.
-They won't answer me.

39:12.516 --> 39:14.018
What a fucking joke.

39:27.698 --> 39:28.783
Im Han-rim! Hey!

39:33.704 --> 39:34.538
Fuck you!

39:43.381 --> 39:44.924
What the fuck?

39:49.970 --> 39:50.805
Fuck!

40:04.819 --> 40:05.820
What are you doing?

40:07.655 --> 40:08.948
Come here!

40:28.509 --> 40:29.593
Bong Geun-dae!

40:29.677 --> 40:32.263
-You're being too emotional, kid.
-Bong Geun-dae!

40:32.763 --> 40:33.806
Inspector!

40:56.203 --> 40:57.371
Are you all right?

40:57.455 --> 40:59.165
-Are you hurt anywhere?
-No.

41:03.252 --> 41:05.463
Are you grading cattle or something?

41:05.546 --> 41:07.631
But it's not me that's important.

41:08.299 --> 41:10.801
Their leader is upstairs.

41:12.761 --> 41:14.013
And there are…

41:18.058 --> 41:20.478
Im Han-rim, take care of them
and Deputy Bong.

41:21.228 --> 41:23.189
He's tall and has sparkling eyes.

41:23.272 --> 41:24.982
Very cute.

41:29.278 --> 41:30.446
This way.

41:43.334 --> 41:44.668
Hey!

41:45.461 --> 41:47.087
Where's your leader?

41:48.547 --> 41:50.633
Your leader!

41:50.716 --> 41:52.176
Where is he?

42:10.903 --> 42:13.113
Looks like you learned how to fight.

42:27.044 --> 42:28.295
Hey, your…

42:29.880 --> 42:31.006
Just go to sleep.

43:14.258 --> 43:15.843
Hey!

43:17.636 --> 43:19.346
Oh man, that jackass.

43:20.264 --> 43:22.349
What a hassle.

43:35.863 --> 43:37.197
Shit.

43:37.281 --> 43:38.490
Fucking bastard.

43:38.574 --> 43:40.242
You son of a bitch!

43:49.877 --> 43:51.045
Get out.

43:56.342 --> 43:58.594
Man, that was rough. Right?

44:08.646 --> 44:10.648
Please spare me just this once.

44:14.985 --> 44:16.862
Please spare me.

44:20.115 --> 44:21.283
All right, fine.

44:21.367 --> 44:24.286
If you're going to beg like that,
I guess I can spare you.

44:25.120 --> 44:27.247
But not for free though.

44:28.082 --> 44:29.583
Your crimes are countless.

44:30.125 --> 44:32.419
You like games, don't you?

44:32.503 --> 44:35.214
If you win a game, I'll spare you.
How does that sound?

44:36.215 --> 44:37.132
A game?

44:37.216 --> 44:40.094
You've seen Squid Game, right?
If you win, you live.

44:40.177 --> 44:42.054
If you lose, I smack you. How's that?

44:44.056 --> 44:45.891
We'll play rock, paper, scissors, okay?

44:46.725 --> 44:48.727
Rock, paper, scissors.

44:57.528 --> 44:58.696
Right, we go again.

44:58.779 --> 45:00.656
Rock, paper, scissors.

45:00.739 --> 45:01.573
Well…

45:08.706 --> 45:10.999
-Rock, paper, scissors.
-I…

45:12.876 --> 45:14.128
Wait! Wait a minute!

45:14.211 --> 45:15.504
What? What is it?

45:15.587 --> 45:17.464
No matter what I do,

45:17.965 --> 45:19.717
I'll keep losing.

45:20.926 --> 45:22.720
That's what you did to the kids.

45:23.470 --> 45:24.930
Your crimes are countless.

45:25.013 --> 45:26.932
Robbing them of their friends.

45:29.226 --> 45:30.602
Robbing them of their family.

45:32.521 --> 45:34.231
Robbing them

45:34.982 --> 45:36.734
of the joy of their school days.

45:37.693 --> 45:39.319
Breaking

45:39.862 --> 45:41.864
their parents' hearts.

45:44.908 --> 45:45.743
Get it together!

45:47.453 --> 45:48.370
Last one.

45:48.871 --> 45:50.164
Rock,

45:51.165 --> 45:52.458
paper,

45:53.083 --> 45:54.084
scissors.

45:58.422 --> 46:00.132
Rock!

46:12.561 --> 46:13.771
Fuck.

46:41.173 --> 46:42.007
Jae-yun.

46:47.221 --> 46:48.222
Jae-yun.

46:49.598 --> 46:50.724
Jae-yun.

46:54.269 --> 46:55.312
Jae-yun.

46:57.689 --> 46:59.233
Please help me.

47:02.986 --> 47:03.821
You're okay now.

47:05.614 --> 47:06.824
You're okay now.

47:10.244 --> 47:11.203
You're okay.

47:31.723 --> 47:32.766
There…

47:34.017 --> 47:35.394
It's okay.

47:37.062 --> 47:38.021
What's up with him?

47:38.105 --> 47:40.274
He's scared.
Imagine what they must've done.

47:40.858 --> 47:42.234
It's all coming back to him.

47:42.317 --> 47:44.903
I'm going to go talk to them.

47:45.404 --> 47:46.738
-Stay with him, okay?
-Okay.

47:46.822 --> 47:48.156
You're his guardian angel.

47:49.658 --> 47:50.534
Where are you…

47:50.617 --> 47:52.411
You did great, Deputy Director Bong.

47:56.039 --> 47:59.001
I saw you in a different light.
You were amazing.

48:02.629 --> 48:06.258
You said you were watching over me.
Do you know how scared I was?

48:06.341 --> 48:08.719
They held a knife up to my eye
and took my bag.

48:12.055 --> 48:15.392
Don't cry. I am really sorry.

48:15.475 --> 48:19.354
I'll never lose you again.
I'll protect you for life.

48:19.438 --> 48:20.689
Just forget it…

48:22.024 --> 48:22.858
For life?

48:23.859 --> 48:26.361
Why would you protect me for life?

48:27.613 --> 48:30.991
Oh, maybe not for life.

48:32.075 --> 48:33.118
Just during work hours?

48:34.077 --> 48:34.912
Oh, yeah.

48:34.995 --> 48:38.040
What was that stuff you said
when you came looking for me?

48:38.123 --> 48:40.500
His eyes are a little small,
but they sparkle.

48:40.584 --> 48:42.169
He gives major geek vibes,

48:42.252 --> 48:44.338
but up close, he's got a cute face.

48:44.421 --> 48:48.216
He's tall and looks like a smart cookie!

48:52.346 --> 48:55.015
Oh, I was just

48:56.391 --> 48:57.225
describing you?

48:57.309 --> 48:59.603
I've never in my life heard
that my eyes are small.

48:59.686 --> 49:03.482
My eyes aren't very big,
but they're not that small either.

49:03.565 --> 49:05.651
Take a good look.
Are they really that small?

49:06.485 --> 49:07.319
Are they?

49:10.155 --> 49:11.114
They're not, right?

49:14.326 --> 49:15.410
Wow, that's…

49:15.911 --> 49:17.287
-Right?
-Have you seen this?

49:17.371 --> 49:18.455
Shall we take a look?

49:18.538 --> 49:21.583
Don't change the subject.
Just say my eyes aren't small.

49:22.084 --> 49:24.086
Have you been here before? It's beautiful.

49:24.169 --> 49:25.963
When would I have come here?

49:26.046 --> 49:28.632
This place… It's really beautiful.

49:30.842 --> 49:32.552
You have very big eyes.

49:33.220 --> 49:35.681
They're not big.
They're just not small either.

49:36.306 --> 49:37.683
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

49:37.766 --> 49:38.642
Thank you.

49:38.725 --> 49:40.102
My pleasure.

49:40.602 --> 49:41.687
Thank you.

49:46.608 --> 49:49.820
Thanks to you,
Jae-yun's health has improved.

49:50.529 --> 49:51.363
Right.

49:51.446 --> 49:53.991
But I don't think
I deserve to be a father.

49:55.033 --> 49:57.369
I didn't even know
Jae-yun had been dragged off

49:57.995 --> 49:59.287
and suffered all that.

50:01.123 --> 50:04.751
All the while, I was blaming that damn kid
for running away from home.

50:04.835 --> 50:09.464
But because you didn't give up on him
and came to the ERPB for help,

50:09.548 --> 50:11.758
we were able to save Jae-yun
and the other kids.

50:15.721 --> 50:16.722
Minister.

50:18.974 --> 50:21.018
I'm glad Jae-yun is back,

50:22.144 --> 50:24.938
but honestly,
I'm not sure if I've got it in me.

50:28.316 --> 50:30.318
I'm scared he'll start gambling again.

50:33.071 --> 50:35.532
You would've given up already
if you were going to.

50:35.615 --> 50:37.534
Just like you always have,

50:38.035 --> 50:39.745
don't give up this time either.

50:39.828 --> 50:42.039
That's the only way you can change him.

50:46.418 --> 50:47.461
You won't be alone.

50:48.045 --> 50:49.671
The ERPB will help you.

50:50.881 --> 50:52.299
Thank you.

50:58.263 --> 50:59.890
Thank you.

51:04.770 --> 51:07.355
I'VE BEEN MAKING FOOLISH MISTAKES
SINCE I STARTED GAMBLING

51:11.735 --> 51:13.278
TEEN GAMBLING COUNSELING FORM

51:23.830 --> 51:25.582
Will you tell him, or should I?

51:31.254 --> 51:32.255
Jae-yun.

51:33.006 --> 51:35.300
The one who sold you out
to the gambling operators

51:36.843 --> 51:37.677
was me.

51:39.137 --> 51:41.932
I'm the one who got you into gambling
in the first place.

51:42.432 --> 51:45.435
And when you swore off gambling
and switched to a flip phone…

51:47.229 --> 51:49.064
I'm not telling you to gamble.

51:49.147 --> 51:51.733
Just read webtoons on this
when you're bored.

51:53.985 --> 51:55.028
You fucking asshole.

51:55.112 --> 51:57.072
How could you do this to me?

51:57.739 --> 52:00.617
We've been joined at the hip
since elementary school!

52:00.700 --> 52:02.369
We've been such close friends.

52:02.452 --> 52:03.829
I had no choice.

52:03.912 --> 52:06.748
They threatened to call my parents,
so I did as they told me to.

52:12.796 --> 52:13.672
Sit down.

52:14.631 --> 52:15.465
Sit down.

52:18.885 --> 52:20.929
You will be punished accordingly.

52:21.012 --> 52:23.974
At school,
you'll be suspended or expelled.

52:24.474 --> 52:27.018
Outside of school,
you'll be punished under the law.

52:27.102 --> 52:29.646
If you're lucky,
it might end with community service,

52:30.147 --> 52:31.439
or you could go to prison.

52:32.732 --> 52:33.900
This isn't fair.

52:33.984 --> 52:35.610
It's all because of adults.

52:35.694 --> 52:37.946
They used us to make money.

52:38.029 --> 52:39.573
We're victims too!

52:39.656 --> 52:42.325
What did you go through
to call yourself a victim?

52:43.076 --> 52:44.077
Victims?

52:45.370 --> 52:47.372
What about the parents

52:47.455 --> 52:51.376
who lost their life savings and home
and even quit their jobs

52:52.460 --> 52:54.087
because of their kid's gambling?

52:56.590 --> 53:00.510
What about the father who's slapped
in public by someone half his age…

53:03.013 --> 53:05.724
but still has to kneel and beg,
all because of his kid?

53:11.313 --> 53:13.815
What about the mother
who scrubs greasy grills

53:13.899 --> 53:15.609
in the kitchen of a barbecue joint

53:15.692 --> 53:18.028
because the father can't do anything else

53:19.112 --> 53:20.113
but watch their kid?

53:25.911 --> 53:29.998
What about the father
who goes from the police to the ERPB,

53:30.498 --> 53:36.171
even while being looked down on
and treated like some peddler,

53:36.254 --> 53:40.383
begging and crying for his child
to be saved?

53:48.808 --> 53:49.768
Victims?

53:53.063 --> 53:55.106
They're the real victims.

54:01.446 --> 54:04.741
You had countless chances to stop.

54:06.076 --> 54:08.787
And you're the ones
who threw those chances away.

54:13.500 --> 54:17.545
Do you really want to quit gambling
and be forgiven by the people around you?

54:18.880 --> 54:20.840
Then admit you are perpetrators.

54:23.301 --> 54:25.887
Never stop reflecting on yourselves

54:27.138 --> 54:28.890
and never stop asking for forgiveness.

54:32.560 --> 54:34.521
This is your last chance.

55:01.589 --> 55:02.924
Here you go.

55:03.883 --> 55:05.302
It's hot, isn't it?

55:08.179 --> 55:09.139
Oscillate.

55:12.183 --> 55:14.352
You earn money through labor.

55:14.436 --> 55:16.730
There's no such thing
as a get-rich-quick scheme.

55:17.772 --> 55:19.816
Keep scrubbing.

55:19.899 --> 55:22.068
-Scrub your minds clean.
-You need more suds.

55:22.652 --> 55:23.820
Hand it over.

55:26.740 --> 55:28.491
That's it. Good.

55:30.869 --> 55:36.624
That means you now have
98,320,000 won left to pay your parents.

55:36.708 --> 55:38.960
You clean up your own mess.

55:39.044 --> 55:40.462
Oh, and…

55:43.256 --> 55:45.592
To page, press one. To record a message…

55:47.719 --> 55:48.678
Your pagers.

55:49.262 --> 55:50.096
4868253.

55:50.180 --> 55:51.723
Do you remember what this means?

55:51.806 --> 55:53.058
"I love you. Come quickly."

55:53.892 --> 55:54.726
Love you.

55:54.809 --> 55:58.063
Please give our phones back now.
We'll only make calls.

55:58.146 --> 56:00.231
What high schooler
would use this nowadays?

56:00.315 --> 56:03.151
Freedom is only granted
when you take responsibility.

56:03.234 --> 56:04.778
And most importantly,

56:05.362 --> 56:07.155
I don't believe a gambler's word.

56:07.864 --> 56:09.032
I'll page you.

56:10.158 --> 56:11.951
337337.

56:12.452 --> 56:14.537
Oh man.

56:17.207 --> 56:18.249
It's really fine.

56:18.333 --> 56:21.503
After all, I'm the reason
your phone is broken.

56:21.586 --> 56:25.173
It's just the screen that's broken.
It's still usable.

56:27.258 --> 56:28.343
I just feel bad.

56:29.010 --> 56:31.846
I said I'd protect you, but I failed.

56:31.930 --> 56:33.390
So please, okay?

56:33.473 --> 56:36.059
Just pick one.
There are so many phones here.

56:36.142 --> 56:37.644
-Which is the latest?
-It's fine.

56:37.727 --> 56:38.561
Come on, pick one.

56:38.645 --> 56:39.979
-What's the latest--
-Oh?

56:41.231 --> 56:43.900
Then I'll just take a quick look.

56:45.068 --> 56:46.903
-Do you know this one?
-Yes.

56:46.986 --> 56:51.074
They changed the CPU on this model,
so the Internet should be really fast.

56:51.157 --> 56:52.242
-It's so cool.
-I see.

56:52.325 --> 56:53.159
Look.

56:53.243 --> 56:54.285
Right.

57:15.598 --> 57:17.225
Sir, can I please get a flip phone?

57:17.308 --> 57:19.102
-No, we don't need one.
-A flip phone.

57:19.769 --> 57:21.062
I'm not the addictive type.

57:21.146 --> 57:22.188
-Not anymore.
-Hello?

57:22.272 --> 57:24.858
-I'm bringing another addict, sir.
-I'm not an addict.

57:24.941 --> 57:26.192
-Sir, I'm not…
-Yes, sir.

57:26.276 --> 57:27.444
Goodbye.

57:27.527 --> 57:28.653
-Hwang Gi-tae!
-Hello.

57:28.736 --> 57:29.946
One, two.

57:30.029 --> 57:34.742
Hwang Gi-tae!

57:34.826 --> 57:36.703
-Your shop is…
-Life is so tough.

57:36.786 --> 57:37.704
-Here.
-Thank you.

57:37.787 --> 57:38.746
In the latest poll,

57:38.830 --> 57:42.375
Minister Choi Gang-seok
surpassed 50% approval for the first time,

57:42.459 --> 57:46.337
outpacing opposition leader Hwang Gi-tae
by 17%.

57:46.421 --> 57:49.632
Whether Minister Choi Gang-seok
will enter the presidential race…

57:49.716 --> 57:52.051
-Well, then.
-Please look out for us.

57:52.135 --> 57:52.969
Thank you.

57:53.052 --> 57:54.262
This way, please.

57:54.345 --> 57:56.347
-Thank you for treating us, sir.
-Thank you.

57:56.973 --> 57:58.141
All right.

57:59.225 --> 58:01.102
I see you're already out campaigning.

58:02.103 --> 58:04.147
-Choi Gang-seok?
-Choi Gang-seok?

58:04.230 --> 58:05.857
-Why is he here?
-Have a seat.

58:05.940 --> 58:07.358
I'm a regular here. Great food.

58:08.359 --> 58:10.737
Ma'am, can I get another tang here?

58:10.820 --> 58:12.947
Just a moment, please.

58:24.834 --> 58:28.713
Why are you visiting the markets
before even registering as a candidate?

58:29.380 --> 58:31.799
Isn't that something you do
while campaigning?

58:32.300 --> 58:34.844
-This looks delicious.
-Yes, it's good.

58:36.346 --> 58:38.181
Minister Choi Gang-seok, have you heard?

58:38.264 --> 58:39.390
Oh, right.

58:40.308 --> 58:42.727
People don't really hear
the things said about them.

58:45.480 --> 58:47.857
I heard rumors in Yeouido.

58:49.651 --> 58:52.445
You're using your dead daughter
to make a run for president.

58:53.738 --> 58:55.907
They say politics is heartless.

59:10.296 --> 59:12.340
You're all ears when it's about others.

59:12.924 --> 59:16.010
I hear the Mirae Daehan Party
is holding an emergency meeting today.

59:18.221 --> 59:19.681
I guess you weren't told.

59:20.181 --> 59:22.225
I wonder what they need to discuss

59:23.476 --> 59:25.478
that they didn't tell you about.

59:28.940 --> 59:31.776
Could they be planning
to replace their presidential candidate

59:31.859 --> 59:34.696
because your approval ratings
are dropping?

59:39.742 --> 59:41.119
Whose idea was this?

59:41.202 --> 59:43.413
I'll head over
to the conference room right now.

59:45.081 --> 59:47.709
I'm the Mirae Daehan Party leader!

59:47.792 --> 59:49.210
Who's going to stop me?

59:51.296 --> 59:52.297
What is it?

59:54.424 --> 59:56.092
Sir, you have a visitor.

59:56.175 --> 59:58.219
Do I look like I want company right now?

59:58.803 --> 01:00:01.014
He has something to tell you
about the ERPB.

01:02:07.765 --> 01:02:10.727
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
